<title>LUXEMBOURG: Cargolux FTKs see 3pct rise for first 7.</title>
<headline>Cargolux FTKs see 3pct rise for first 7.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargolux Airlines International said it flew 167.4 million freight tonne kilometres, FTK, in July 1996, compared to 166.8 million FTK in the same month last year.</p>
<p>In the first seven months of 1996, the Luxembourg-based cargo airline flew a total of 1.11 billion FTK, an increase of three percent on 1995 levels, Cargolux said.</p>
<p>Cargolux  operates a fleet of  747-400F and  747-200F aircraft.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom tel:+44 171 542 7706 fax:+44 171 542 5017</p>
